## Rules
1. Use ONLY data from the intake_json — do NOT invent slide content (interactive prompts/quiz
   options may be newly composed, but must test understanding of material that IS in the source).
2. Every slide MUST have "id", "type", and "notes".
3. "h1" is the main slide heading (displayed in brand red). Keep under 60 characters.
4. "h2" is the subtitle (displayed in black) and must be a full declarative sentence — see the
   Assertion-evidence heading rule above. Keep under 100 characters. Be specific, not generic.
5. All Vietnamese text must use full diacritics.
6. code_snippet must be verbatim from the lesson — no invented code.
7. Total slides: 14-18, following the ordering rules above (including mandatory "interactive"
   cadence and the separate "exercises" slide).
8. Output ONLY the JSON object.
